  Code:
     0: new           #7      // class SoSanh$1        ← (A) NEW một class có sẵn
     3: dup
     4: invokespecial #9      // Method SoSanh$1."<init>":()V
     7: astore_1

     8: invokedynamic #10, 0  // InvokeDynamic #0:test:()Ljava/util/function/Predicate;
                              //     ⭐⭐ (B) LAMBDA → invokedynamic, KHÔNG có "new"
    13: astore_2
    ...

private static boolean lambda$main$0(java.lang.String);   ← ⭐ thân lambda thành method tĩnh
  Code:
     0: aload_0
     1: invokevirtual #30     // Method java/lang/String.isEmpty:()Z
     4: ireturn
```

**Bước 4 — Xem BootstrapMethods (nơi phép màu xảy ra):**

```bash
javap -v -p SoSanh.class | tail -20
```

```text
BootstrapMethods:
  0: #45 REF_invokeStatic java/lang/invoke/LambdaMetafactory.metafactory:
        (Ljava/lang/invoke/MethodHandles$Lookup;Ljava/lang/String;
         Ljava/lang/invoke/MethodType;Ljava/lang/invoke/MethodType;
         Ljava/lang/invoke/MethodHandle;Ljava/lang/invoke/MethodType;)
