        // ⭐ assertThatThrownBy nhận ThrowingCallable (functional interface)
        assertThatThrownBy(() -> productService.getById(99L))
                .isInstanceOf(ResourceNotFoundException.class)
                .hasMessageContaining("99");
    }

    @Test
    void search_FiltersCorrectly() {
        List<Product> products = List.of(
                new Product(1L, "Laptop", new BigDecimal("25000000")),
                new Product(2L, "Chuột",  new BigDecimal("250000")));

        // ⭐ ArgumentMatcher là functional interface
        when(productRepository.findAll(any(Specification.class), any(Pageable.class)))
                .thenReturn(new PageImpl<>(products));

        Page<ProductDto> result = productService.search("lap", Pageable.unpaged());

        // ⭐ AssertJ + lambda
        assertThat(result.getContent())
                .hasSize(2)
                .extracting(ProductDto::name)             // ⭐ method reference
                .containsExactly("Laptop", "Chuột");
    }
}
```

**Functional interface trong thư viện test:**

| Thư viện | Interface | Dùng làm |
|----------|-----------|----------|
| JUnit 5 | `Executable` | `assertThrows(X.class, () -> ...)` |
| JUnit 5 | `ThrowingSupplier<T>` | `assertDoesNotThrow(() -> ...)` |
| AssertJ | `ThrowingCallable` | `assertThatThrownBy(() -> ...)` |
| AssertJ | `Consumer<T>` | `.satisfies(x -> ...)` |
| Mockito | `Answer<T>` | `.thenAnswer(inv -> ...)` |
| Mockito | `ArgumentMatcher<T>` | `argThat(x -> x.getId() > 0)` |

### 16.10 Bảng: kiến thức chương này dùng ở đâu trong Spring Boot

| Kiến thức | Xuất hiện ở |
|-----------|-------------|
| Generic interface `<T, ID>` | `JpaRepository<T, ID>`, `CrudRepository<T, ID>` |
| Generic class | `ResponseEntity<T>`, `Page<T>`, `Optional<T>`, `Mono<T>`, `Flux<T>` |
| Generic record | DTO wrapper: `ApiResponse<T>`, `PageResponse<T>` |
| Bounded type | `<T extends Comparable<T>>` trong sort utility |
| Wildcard/PECS | Mọi API nhận `Collection<? extends T>` |
| Type erasure workaround | `ParameterizedTypeReference<List<Dto>>` |
| `Class<T>` token | `applicationContext.getBean(MyService.class)` |
| `Supplier<T>` | `orElseThrow(() -> ...)`, `@Bean` lazy |
| `Function<T,R>` | `Page.map()`, `Optional.map()`, `Stream.map()` |
| `Predicate<T>` | `Stream.filter()`, `Collection.removeIf()` |
| `Consumer<T>` | `forEach`, `ifPresent`, config DSL |
| `Comparator<T>` | `Sort`, sắp xếp in-memory |
| Method reference | `.map(this::toDto)`, `AbstractHttpConfigurer::disable` |
| Functional composition | `Specification.and()/or()`, `Predicate.and()` |
| Lambda DSL | Spring Security 6 config |
| Bridge method | `BridgeMethodResolver` khi Spring quét `@Transactional` |

