## 📎 Phụ Lục B — Bảng Tra Nhanh Cú Pháp Generics

| Cú pháp | Nghĩa | Ví dụ |
|---------|-------|-------|
| `class C<T>` | Generic class | `class Box<T>` |
| `interface I<T>` | Generic interface | `interface List<E>` |
| `<T> R method(...)` | Generic method | `<T> T first(List<T> l)` |
| `<T extends X>` | Upper bound | `<T extends Number>` |
| `<T extends A & B>` | Multiple bounds | `<T extends Number & Comparable<T>>` |
| `<T extends C<T>>` | Recursive bound | `<T extends Comparable<T>>` |
| `C<?>` | Unbounded wildcard | `List<?>` |
| `C<? extends T>` | Upper bounded wildcard | `List<? extends Number>` |
| `C<? super T>` | Lower bounded wildcard | `List<? super Integer>` |
| `new C<>()` | Diamond operator | `new ArrayList<>()` |
| `Class.<T>method()` | Explicit type argument | `Collections.<String>emptyList()` |
| `C<T>::new` | Constructor reference | `ArrayList<String>::new` |
| `T[]::new` | Array constructor ref | `String[]::new` |
| `@SafeVarargs` | Cam kết varargs an toàn | Trên method static/final/private |
| `@SuppressWarnings("unchecked")` | Tắt cảnh báo | Phạm vi hẹp nhất |

