| `T` | `Object` |
| `T extends Number` | `Number` |
| `T extends Comparable<T> & Serializable` | `Comparable` |
| `List<String>` | `List` |
| `List<? extends Number>` | `List` |
| `Map<K,V>` | `Map` |
| `T[]` | `Object[]` |
| `List<T>[]` | `List[]` |

